        <detaileddescription>
<para>This function retrieves all values associated with a specific key within a particular section of the INI file. If no such key exists, it logs an error message and returns an empty vector. The results are sorted based on their load order as defined by CSimpleIniA::Entry::LoadOrder().</para>
