</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>Key</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>A string representing the key whose values are to be retrieved. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>A vector of strings containing all values associated with the provided key in the specified section, sorted based on their load order. If no such key exists, an empty vector is returned.</para>
